<div class="pol-tldr"><b>the short version</b><ul><li>free shipping on every order, anywhere we deliver in India</li><li>orders ship within 5–7 working days</li><li>tracking link sent on WhatsApp once it ships</li></ul></div>
<h2>where we ship</h2>
<p>We currently ship to addresses across India. We don't ship internationally yet. If you'd like us to, tell us on <a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a>.</p>
<h2>shipping cost</h2>
<p>Shipping is free on every order. There are no hidden delivery charges at checkout.</p>
<h2>when your order ships</h2>
<p>Orders are packed and handed to our courier partner within <b>5–7 working days</b> of a successful payment. Working days are Monday to Saturday, excluding public holidays. Delivery time after dispatch depends on your pincode; most orders arrive within a few days of shipping.</p>
<h2>tracking</h2>
<p>Once your order ships, we'll send the tracking link to the WhatsApp number you gave at checkout. Lost it? Message us with your order number and we'll resend it.</p>
<h2>wrong address or missed delivery</h2>
<p>Please double-check your address and pincode at checkout. If you spot a mistake, message us before your order ships and we'll fix it. If a parcel comes back to us because of an incorrect address or repeated failed delivery attempts, we'll contact you to arrange re-delivery.</p>
<h2>damaged or missing items</h2>
<p>If your parcel arrives damaged, opened, or with something missing, message us within 48 hours of delivery with your order number and a photo of the package and contents, and we'll make it right.</p>
<h2>questions</h2>
<p><a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' }}">WhatsApp 95673 09388</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ settings.support_email }}">{{ settings.support_email }}</a>. A real person replies.</p>
